---
description: React Three Fiber and animation performance rules
globs: ["apps/web/**/*3d*/**", "apps/web/**/*Scene*.{js,jsx}", "apps/web/**/*canvas*/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Load the Canvas with next/dynamic (ssr: false) after first paint; show a poster image first.
- Use instancing for repeated meshes, Draco/KTX2 for assets, no per-frame allocations, no setState in useFrame.
- frameloop="demand" when the scene is static; pause when offscreen or tab hidden.
- Use drei PerformanceMonitor to lower DPR and effects on weak devices.
- Provide a static fallback for reduced motion, no WebGL and low power mode.
- Keep the 3D chunk out of the initial bundle budget (170 KB gz) and verify with the bundle analyzer.
